      id: "q55", type: "short_answer", section: "response",
      stem: "Do you want to be a person like Andy? Why or why not?",
      answer: "Yes, because I love writing and reading too.",
      explanation: "### 📖 参考答案 **Yes, because I love writing and reading too.**\n这是**个人观点 + 理由题**——答 Yes 或 No 都可以，**关键是要给出理由**，并且理由要**和 Andy 的特点相关**。参考答案选 Yes，理由是\"我也喜欢写作和阅读\"，呼应了 Andy 的核心特征。\n\n### 🔎 答题思路 (How to Approach)\n**两步法**：\n1. **明确态度**：Yes / No（必须有一个明确立场）。\n2. **给出理由**：用 **because** 引出，理由要**具体**，不能笼统。\n\n可选答法示例：\n- **Yes 版本**：\n  - Yes, because I love writing stories and want to inspire children.\n  - Yes, because Andy is humorous and creative, and I want to be like him.\n  - Yes, because he is healthy, happy, and lives a meaningful life.\n- **No 版本**（也完全可以！）：\n  - No, because I want to be a scientist instead of a writer.\n  - No, because writing every day sounds boring to me; I prefer outdoor activities.\n  - No, because I don't enjoy reading or writing as much as Andy does.\n\n### 🔍 答题技巧 (Answering Tips)\n- **句型推荐**：**Yes/No, because + 完整理由从句**。\n- **理由要\"接得上\"题目**：本题问的是\"想不想像 Andy 一样\"，理由必须扣住 Andy 的特点——爱写作、爱阅读、爱运动、爱想象等。\n- **不要写空话**：避免 \"because I want to\" 或 \"because he is good\" 这种没有内容的句子。\n- 例句：*Yes, because I admire his courage and want to help others too.* 是的，因为我钦佩他的勇气，也想帮助他人。\n\n### ⚠️ 学生常犯错误 (Common Mistakes)\n- **没有理由**：只写 \"Yes.\" 或 \"No, I don't.\" — 严重扣分。开放题**理由部分占主要分数**。\n- **理由太空**：写成 \"Yes, because he is good.\" — \"good\" 没具体内容，没说明哪里好。\n- **态度模糊**：写成 \"Maybe yes, maybe no\" — 必须**选一个立场**。\n- **语法错误**：because 后面必须接**完整句子**，不能只写词组（错例：because love writing）。\n- **离题**：理由与 Andy 完全无关（如 \"因为我喜欢吃饭\"），无法呼应题目。\n\n### 🧠 一句口诀\n**立场要明确，理由扣 Andy**",
